{{!--
  systems/crows/templates/item/trait.hbs
  Same printed-card anatomy as background.hbs (see mockup 3a).

  Needs, in order:
    1. css/crows-card-face.css appended to (or @imported by) css/crows.css
    2. css/crows-trait.css after it
  ADAPTED. Three of the handoff's assumptions do not hold here:

    * `CROWS.traitTrees` is an ARRAY of 23 names, so its `Object.keys()` are
      "0".."22", not tree keys.
    * `CROWS.traitTierCost` does not exist — the XP table is `traitTierXP`,
      with the same 500/1000/1500/2000 values.
    * 23 `CROWS.Sheet.Crow.tree.*` keys already ship, so a new `CROWS.Tree.*`
      family would duplicate every one of them.

  READ-ONLY, like the background sheet. Traits are compendium content authored
  in src/packs/crows-traits/*.yaml and rebuilt by `npm run pack`, so an edit
  made here is discarded at the next build. It also removes a real corruption
  path: `connectsTo` is a StringField ARRAY, and the handoff's comma-separated
  text input would submit a STRING — it says so itself, asking for a split-on-
  comma handler. Not offering the control is safer than writing one.

  Icons are per-TRAIT here, not per-tree as the handoff suggests: all 276 carry
  their own glyph.

  The rules text is {{{rules}}} — enriched HTML, not a textarea. A textarea prints the
  raw <p> tags on the card face.
--}}
<div class="crows-item card-face trait">
  <article class="cf-card">

    <header class="cf-head">
      <div class="cf-titleline">
        <div class="cf-title">{{item.name}}</div>
        <span class="cf-kind">{{localize "TYPES.Item.trait"}}</span>
      </div>

      <div class="cf-origin">
        <div class="cf-glyph">
          <img src="{{item.img}}" alt="">
        </div>
        <div class="cf-originbody">
          <div class="cf-action">{{treeLabel}}</div>
          <div class="cf-meta">
            {{!-- column is a tree-layout coordinate, not player-facing: All fields only --}}
            <span>&#10711; {{localize "CROWS.Trait.Tier"}}
              <span class="cf-num">{{system.tier}}</span>
            </span>
            <span>&#9678; <span class="cf-xp">{{xpCost}}</span> {{localize "CROWS.Trait.Xp"}}</span>
            {{#if system.isStarting}}
              <span class="tr-starting">&#10022; {{localize "CROWS.Trait.StartingTrait"}}</span>
            {{/if}}
            {{#if system.restActivity}}
              <span class="tr-starting">&#10022; {{localize "CROWS.Trait.RestActivity"}}</span>
            {{/if}}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    {{!-- enriched, not raw: a textarea here prints the <p> tags on the card --}}
    <div class="cf-rules">{{{rules}}}</div>

    {{#if leadsTo.length}}
      <section class="cf-note tr-leads">
        <p><span class="cf-runin">{{localize "CROWS.Trait.LeadsTo"}}</span>
          {{#each leadsTo as |t|}}{{t}}{{#unless @last}} &middot; {{/unless}}{{/each}}</p>
      </section>
    {{/if}}

    <div class="cf-foot"></div>
  </article>

</div>
